{"version":1,"content":"<p>從航空出行和銀行交易，到美國國家安全局的機密工作，一連串技術故障正在擾亂美國社會的日常運轉，令公眾對老化技術基礎設施愈發不信任。儘管沒有跡象表明這些事件彼此相關或出自惡意行為方之手，猜疑和不安仍在蔓延。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586906.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:47:02.545073+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:29:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:20.985839+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:20.985839+00:00","content_hash":"71d68ebb9d38f3c2364e284710f398413725c71aeeeeecf7e5f3806e7625aab5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}